        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Islamism</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 1922 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Thinkers</span><span class="info-stat-val"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rashid-rida">Rashid Rida</a> (1865–1935), pioneering theoretician of the Islamic state; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hassan-al-banna">Hassan al-Banna</a>, founder of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/muslim-brotherhood">Muslim Brotherhood</a>; Abul A’la Maududi, founder of Jamaat-e-Islami; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sayyid-qutb">Sayyid Qutb</a> (1906–1966), whose ideas shaped the jihadists; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ruhollah-khomeini">Ruhollah Khomeini</a>, founder of the Islamic Republic of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iran">Iran</a>; Hassan al-Turabi, advocate of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/islamisation">Islamisation</a> through state power</span></div>
